      "text": "On the plain of burning sand the flakes of fire fall slowly, like snow on windless mountains. In the north the fire rolls east like a wave: ride it and do not stop. In the south it flickers: keep moving every turn, and never walk into a rock. An hourglass holds the fire still, for a little while."
